<title>USA: US Medical contract to boost revs.</title>
<headline>US Medical contract to boost revs.</headline>
<dateline>WEST ATLANTIC CITY, N.J. 1996-10-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>US Medical Alliance said on Wednesday that it has entered an agreement to provide physician management services for Reliance Healthcare and Medical Group that will boost revenues to $16 million annually.</p>
<p>The contract provides for $11.5 million in annual revenues, US Medical said.</p>
</text>
